@base = http://localhost:8001/api/v1
@csrf = ISI_DARI_GET_CSRF
@access = ISI_ACCESS_LOGIN
@challenge = ISI_UUID_DARI_EMAIL
@code = ISI_ENAM_DIGIT_DARI_EMAIL

### Aktifkan cookie jar pada alat pengujian; pertahankan localhost dan path cookie.
GET {{base}}/auth/csrf/
Origin: http://localhost:5173

### Register selalu 202 Message bila schema valid dan tidak terkena throttle.
POST {{base}}/auth/register/
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:5173
X-CSRFToken: {{csrf}}

{"full_name":"Pelapor Lokal","email":"pelapor@example.test","password":"GANTI_PASSWORD_PILIHAN_SENDIRI","password_confirm":"GANTI_PASSWORD_PILIHAN_SENDIRI"}

### Salin challenge dan kode dari private_outbox/email terbaru; bukan response register.
POST {{base}}/auth/otp/verify/
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:5173
X-CSRFToken: {{csrf}}

{"challenge_id":"{{challenge}}","code":"{{code}}"}

### Login menyetel refresh cookie; respons JSON hanya access.
POST {{base}}/auth/login/
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:5173
X-CSRFToken: {{csrf}}

{"email":"pelapor@example.test","password":"GANTI_PASSWORD_PILIHAN_SENDIRI"}

### Profil memakai Bearer access dari login.
GET {{base}}/me/
Authorization: Bearer {{access}}

### Refresh hanya cookie + CSRF, body kosong. Cookie jar wajib aktif.
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh/
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:5173
X-CSRFToken: {{csrf}}

{}

### Logout 204 tidak memiliki JSON.
POST {{base}}/auth/logout/
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: http://localhost:5173
X-CSRFToken: {{csrf}}

{}
